'''Loughgall Football Club''', also referred to as simply '''Loughgall''', or '''The Villagers''', is a semi-professional [[Northern Ireland|Northern Irish]] [[football (soccer)|football]] club currently playing in the [[NIFL Championship]]. Loughgall are a part of the [[Mid-Ulster F.A.|Mid-Ulster Football Association]]. The club plays in the [[Irish Cup]]."}}
